# graphify's own output directory — exclude it from the corpus scan.
# Without this, the wiki/ and obsidian/ exports (100k+ markdown notes) get
# counted as corpus documents on the next run.
graphify-out/
.graphify-stale-artifacts/

# Session/runtime state — changes every session, never knowledge content.
.mimosa/
.plan-tmp/

# Pre-restructure copy of the old tree (untracked backup at code-fusion/cf-old/).
# It holds the *complete* pre-rebrand CodeFusion source plus its installed
# node_modules and build output (apps/web/dist, .cf-build, scripts/release).
# Indexing it would duplicate every pre-rebrand symbol next to the live one, so it
# stays out of the corpus; see code-fusion/cf-old/OLD-TREE-NOTICE.md.
code-fusion/cf-old/

# Dependency trees — generated, never authored.
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/

# Throwaway probe scripts (Oct 23 coverage investigation), not project source.
code-fusion/tmp/

# Test-snapshot fixtures — recorded expected data (replay.override.json,
# *.expected.json/txt, 1-pixel PNGs). Data, not extractable knowledge.
**/tests/snapshots/

